    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n28312" root="عدف" body-key="E">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدْفٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَدُوفٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>A small quantity of
fodder,</i> or <i>provender.</i> (L, K.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <i>A small
gift.</i> (IF, O, K.) One says, <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَصَبْنَا مِنْ مَالِهِ عَدْفًا</span>
[in the TA <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">فى ماله</span>] i. e. [<i>We obtained from his
property</i>] <i>a small gift.</i> (IF, O.)

